Z||000004||TN Fieros||11-09-2001||07:40 PM||||Paul, I'd be interested in the Excel file and Newsletter swap. Thanks for keeping up the list. It is very helpful.<P>And all of our info is correct as is.<P><BR>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TNFiero[1].gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A><p>[This message has been edited by TN Fieros (edited 11-09-2001).]||||reg||1
